Talisman_SetPower_Sorc04_01.desc:
Once per Cast, damaging enemies draws on Tal Rasha's power, triggering a {c_important}Mastery{/c} Skill, each element has a {c_number}6{/c} second Cooldown:
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_important}Frost{/c} Skills trigger {c_important}Blizzard{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_important}Pyromancy{/c} Skills trigger {c_important}Meteor{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2} {c_important}Shock{/c} Skills trigger {c_important}Ball Lightning{/c}

1HSword_Unique_Paladin_002.desc:
{if:IsMythic}{c_mythic}{/if}Dealing direct damage grants {if:IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_1|2%x|]{/c} increased Critical Strike Damage for each enemy hit within {c_number}10{/c} seconds, up to {if:IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[50*Affix_Value_1|%x|]{/c}.

At Maximum you gain:

{c_label}Lucky Hit:{/c} Critical Strikes have up to a {c_number}50%{/c} chance to deal double damage, Heal for {if:IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_2||]{/c} Life, and refresh the duration of the bonus.{if:IsMythic}{/c_mythic}{/if}

Helm_Unique_Warlock_003.desc:
{if:IsMythic}{c_mythic}{/if}Your Evade transforms you into an angry Lunatic for up to {c_number}15{/c} seconds that explodes dealing {c_important}Command Fallen's{/c} damage and increasing by {c_number}100%{c_lightgray}\[x\]{/c}{/c} for every second you're transformed for.

While you are an angry Lunatic, your Movement speed is increased by {c_number}60%{c_lightgray}\[x\]{/c}{/c} and you periodically spawn a Mini Lunatic that seeks enemies. 

{c_important}Command Fallen{/c} deals {if:IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_1*100|x%|]{/c} increased damage.{if:IsMythic}{/c_mythic}{/if}

Ring_Unique_Druid_05_x2.desc:
{if:IsMythic}{c_mythic}{/if}{icon:bullet,1.2}Gain {if:IsMythic}{c_number}{else}{c_random}{/if}[Affix_Value_1*100|x%|]{/c} bonus Poisoning damage.
{icon:bullet,1.2}Direct damage from {c_important}Werewolf{/c} Skills gain a bonus equal to {c_number}50%{c_lightgray}\[x\]{/c}{/c} of your bonus Poisoning damage, up to {c_number}50%{c_lightgray}\[x\]{/c}{/c}.
{icon:bullet,1.2}Poison damage from Werewolf Skills gain a bonus equal to {c_number}100%{c_lightgray}\[x\]{/c}{/c} of your bonus Attack Speed and Critical Strike Chance, up to {c_number}50%{c_lightgray}\[x\]{/c}{/c}. 

Current Direct Damage bonus: {c_number}[Min((DOT_DPS_Bonus_Percent+DOT_DPS_Bonus_Percent_Per_Damage_Type(4)+Bucketed_Multiplicative_DoT_Damage)*0.5*100,50)|%x|]{/c}
Current Poison Damage bonus: {c_number}[Min((Attack_Speed_Percent_Bonus_Total+Cast_Speed_Percent_Bonus+Crit_Percent_Base+Crit_Percent_Bonus)*100,50)|x%|]{/c}{if:IsMythic}{/c_mythic}{/if}

